<title>USA: Burlington says weather causes some delays.</title>
<headline>Burlington says weather causes some delays.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A succession of harsh winter storms has taken a toll on the locomotive fleet of the Burlington Northern Sante Fe Corp, causing delays to rail freight shipments in several parts of the U.S., company officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>The heavy snowfalls that have battered much of the U.S. Midwest this winter knocked several hundred Burlington Northern locomotives out of service, resulting in a shortage of engines available to move freight throughout the system.</p>
</text>
